    <article class="px-6 lg:px-0">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extralight mb-6">What is CampsiteJS?</h2>
      <p class="text-xl font-extralight leading-8 mb-20"><b>CampsiteJS</b> transforms static site building into an exciting adventure, equipped out-of-the-box with Markdown for simple, readable content creation; Nunjucks and Liquid for advanced templating with logic and data; Vue.js for building reactive, interactive components; Alpine.js for lightweight, easy-to-add interactivity; and Tailwind CSS for rapid, utility-first styling of responsive designs. Ideal for everything from minimalist blogs to complex projects, it makes web development smooth, fast, and enjoyable without needing extra plugins—perfect for solo developers or teams ready to explore the digital wilderness.</p>
    </article>
